(6200659, 916079, 22689, '<td valign="top">I have not been around DPC during quite a long time and I''m glad to see what I poorly call "different points of view", it''s a large category which includes abstract art and deliberately grainy / soft focus / out of focus photos.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately sometimes those photos mean nothing to me or I can''t find any emotional link. <br/>This is not the case but it''s very difficult for me to explain why I like your photo so much. Maybe it''s for what I imagine when I see it or some kind of magic connection.<br/>Thank you.<br/>(my vote 10)</td>', 'I have not been around DPC during quite a long time and I''m glad to see what I poorly call "different points of view", it''s a large category which includes abstract art and deliberately grainy / soft focus / out of focus photos. Unfortunately sometimes those photos mean nothing to me or I can''t find any emotional link. This is not the case but it''s very difficult for me to explain why I like your photo so much. Maybe it''s for what I imagine when I see it or some kind of magic connection.Thank you.(my vote 10)', '2010-10-25 10:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6200698, 915951, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good job with getting the exposure balanced on this shot. The overall shot doesn''t strike me as super interesting, other than the sun streaming through the branches.</td>', 'Good job with getting the exposure balanced on this shot. The overall shot doesn''t strike me as super interesting, other than the sun streaming through the branches.', '2010-10-25 10:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6200701, 915971, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of post processing to make this feel more like a dream. I wasn''t sure about the blown out sky at first, but being "dream" I think it make work.</td>', 'Good use of post processing to make this feel more like a dream. I wasn''t sure about the blown out sky at first, but being "dream" I think it make work.', '2010-10-25 10:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6200703, 916096, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of lines/shadows. The topaz effect is a bit heavy for my taste.</td>', 'Good composition and use of lines/shadows. The topaz effect is a bit heavy for my taste.', '2010-10-25 10:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6200705, 915700, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing the action. One word of advice would be to put him to the left side of this frame so he has room to "run in to."</td>', 'Nice job capturing the action. One word of advice would be to put him to the left side of this frame so he has room to "run in to."', '2010-10-25 10:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6200706, 916066, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good use of blur. Still have an actual subject here, and makes the photo more interesting.</td>', 'Very good use of blur. Still have an actual subject here, and makes the photo more interesting.', '2010-10-25 10:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
