(6203737, 916096, 43774, '<td valign="top">Way overprocessed for my tastes. HDR should be subtle and a means of improving the photo, not making it into a mess.<br/> <br/>I really like the lighthouse, the sky looks great IF it wasn''t overprocessed. Horizon is also tilted. Sorry to be so harsh but those are the feelings I get from this photo.</td>', 'Way overprocessed for my tastes. HDR should be subtle and a means of improving the photo, not making it into a mess. I really like the lighthouse, the sky looks great IF it wasn''t overprocessed. Horizon is also tilted. Sorry to be so harsh but those are the feelings I get from this photo.', '2010-10-28 18:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
