(6205167, 916050, 47470, '<td valign="top">I can''t think of whose series this reminds me of, but I find myself looking for the umbrella.  I really wish it had one just to add a bit more dream-absurdity.</td>', 'I can''t think of whose series this reminds me of, but I find myself looking for the umbrella.  I really wish it had one just to add a bit more dream-absurdity.', '2010-10-30 16:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
