(6205589, 916050, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love it! Great story. At first I thought Grimmy was escorting him along, but now it looks like he''s pushing him into the soft ground.</td>', 'Love it! Great story. At first I thought Grimmy was escorting him along, but now it looks like he''s pushing him into the soft ground.', '2010-10-31 12:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
