(6207942, 916034, 122149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> ur too funny. all that questioning about why someone would bother entering anything but eye candy and then you go and enter this photo. weird and wonderful. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Lol. thank you, that means a lot coming from you. there are two reasons why i entered this one. one: i love it. two: you guys convinced me that it''s better to enter something i love and i''m proud of, instead of just something for a ribbon just cuz it''s clear and crisp. plus, my camera is not so great and/or i''m not very experienced with it yet to take those clear shots. and lately...i''m kind of bored of those.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: ur too funny. all that questioning about why someone would bother entering anything but eye candy and then you go and enter this photo. weird and wonderful.   Lol. thank you, that means a lot coming from you. there are two reasons why i entered this one. one: i love it. two: you guys convinced me that it''s better to enter something i love and i''m proud of, instead of just something for a ribbon just cuz it''s clear and crisp. plus, my camera is not so great and/or i''m not very experienced with it yet to take those clear shots. and lately...i''m kind of bored of those.', '2010-11-01 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6207944, 916034, 122149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> The dreamer or the dream? I''m putting this on the first floor of my dream gallery. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The dreamer is dreaming she''s paralized. :) I used to have those dreams all the time when i could hear everything around me and couldn''t move,and was trying to talk and couldn''t. felt paralized. i''m surprised more people didn''t like this. i think it''s great.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: The dreamer or the dream? I''m putting this on the first floor of my dream gallery.   The dreamer is dreaming she''s paralized. :) I used to have those dreams all the time when i could hear everything around me and couldn''t move,and was trying to talk and couldn''t. felt paralized. i''m surprised more people didn''t like this. i think it''s great.', '2010-11-01 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
