(6209106, 915971, 33361, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m thinking this is Steve (Spiffy) for no better reason than that there''s a train and some light humor. Excellent shot in any case... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Roseann, You''ll have to decide if you are flattered or insulted by this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>How could that ever be an insult?!? Goofball!! You know we were probably siamese twins in a previous life.. hehehe</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Originally posted by bvy: I''m thinking this is Steve (Spiffy) for no better reason than that there''s a train and some light humor. Excellent shot in any case...  Roseann, You''ll have to decide if you are flattered or insulted by this.   How could that ever be an insult?!? Goofball!! You know we were probably siamese twins in a previous life.. hehehe', '2010-11-02 19:41:44.000000', NULL, 0),
